managePositionBatch.t.sol
├── when call is reentrant
│  └── it should revert
└── when call is not reentrant
   ├── given the module is suspended
   │  └── it should revert with Suspended
   └── given the module is not suspended
      ├── given the module is paused
      │  └── it should revert with Paused
      └── given the module is not paused
         ├── when caller is not a registered operator
         │  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
         └── when caller is a registered operator
            ├── when the management and accounting instruction lists have different lengths
            │  └── it should revert with MismatchedLengths
            └── when the management and accounting instruction lists have the same length
               ├── it should manage each provided pair of management and optional accounting instructions sequentially, as managePosition does
               └── it should return the resulting position values and value changes
